          "filename": "Näsilinna building in Tampere 20121120 001.jpg",
          "caption": "\"Näsilinna\", a former palace on Näsikallio, Tampere, Finland. Designed by architect Karl August Wrede, the building was originally completed in 1898 as \"Milavida\" for Peter von Nottbeck, one of the sons of the industrialist Wilhelm von Nottbeck. Since 1908, it has housed the Häme Museum.",
